    "description": "Audio Cassette Tape Lot - 4 Tapes\nTDK & Maxell, Late 1980s-1990s\nAnalog Audio Cassettes with Jewel Cases\nLot of four vintage audio cassette tapes featuring quality magnetic media from premier manufacturers TDK and Maxell. These cassettes showcase popular late 20th-century tape formulations, including high-bias Type II and normal-bias Type I formats, enclosed in protective hard plastic cases with J-card inserts.\n1x Maxell XLII-S 90 High Position IEC Type II CrO2 cassette\n1x TDK D90 Dynamic Cassette Normal Position IEC Type I tape\n1x TDK D50 Dynamic Cassette Normal Position IEC Type I tape\n1x TDK cassette tape with clear shell and case insert\nEach cassette housed in a transparent plastic case with J-card liner\nCondition:\nPre-owned vintage condition. Cassettes feature previous home recordings with handwritten titles on tape labels and J-card liner sleeves as pictured. Tape spools appear intact and neatly wound with no visible creases or unraveling. Jewel cases display light cosmetic shelf wear and surface scuffing consistent with age.",
